    "description": "Does the Government know what it\u2019s doing with Sinopec?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Does-the-Government-know-what-it-s-doing-with-Sinopec/4-783807",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
