    "description": "Allianz Insurance Lanka lends its support to \u2018Preserving Land and Nature\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/allianz-insurance-lanka-lends-its-support-to-preserving-land-and-nature/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
