    "chunk_text": "Through this commemorative oration, the Foundation seeks to honor Dr. Corea\u2019s enduring legacy and to reflect on the continued relevance of his ideas for the challenges facing the Global South today.\n\nThe oration, titled \u201cDr. Gamani Corea and His Enduring Relevance for the Global South,\u201d will be delivered by Dr. Carlos Maria Correa, Executive Director of the South Centre, Geneva, Switzerland.\n\nThe event will take place on Tuesday, 4th November 2025, from 5.30 p.m. onwards, at The Lighthouse auditorium, 24 Horton Place, Colombo 7.\n\nAllianz Insurance Lanka lends its support to \u2018Preserving Land and Nature\u2019\n\nSEC celebrates 38th anniversary with a bell-ringing ceremony at CSE\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
