    "chunk_size_bytes": 1684,
    "chunk_text": "Mark and Comm partners with Meridian Creative Solutions\n\nMark and Comm (Pvt) Ltd, Sri Lanka\u2019s leading boutique public relations (PR) and communications agency, has formed a strategic partnership with Meridian Creative Solutions, extending the agency\u2019s unified offering that addresses the full spectrum of modern brand building, from reputation strategy to technical execution.\n\nThe collaboration brings together Mark and Comm\u2019s 14+ years of strategic communications, brand positioning, crisis management, corporate affairs and media relations expertise with Meridian\u2019s capabilities in custom software development, UI/UX design, and digital ecosystem architecture, addressing a critical market gap where brand narrative and digital capability remain disconnected.\n\n\u201cBrand reputation and digital infrastructure are no longer parallel tracks. They\u2019re interdependent,\u201d said Thanzyl Thajudeen, Managing Director of Mark and Comm. \u201cOrganizations need platforms that embody their narratives, systems that deliver on brand promises, and digital experiences that reinforce positioning. This partnership delivers that continuity.\u201d\n\nMark and Comm brings to the partnership its established reputation for PR-led ideas and strategies, alongside its international network spanning the GlobalCom PR Network\u2019s 100+ countries, PRCA APAC corporate membership, and non-exclusive affiliations with leading global agencies.\n\nSEC celebrates 38th anniversary with a bell-ringing ceremony at CSE\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
