    "description": "Retaining talent: The missing link in tourism\u2019s recovery",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/retaining-talent-the-missing-link-in-tourisms-recovery/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
    "time_ut": 1762191180.0,
