    "description": "New national operations unit to shield Sri Lanka\u2019s forests to be unveiled today",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/new-national-operations-unit-to-shield-sri-lankas-forests-to-be-unveiled-today/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
