    "description": "SJB backs anti-drug drive but slams Govt. over Customs scandal and politicised appointments",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/SJB-backs-anti-drug-drive-but-slams-Govt-over-Customs-scandal-and-politicised-appointments/56-783890",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
