    "description": "Sri Lanka\u2019s Northern Gateway: Economic promise and geopolitical power in the Indian Ocean",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/sri-lankas-northern-gateway-economic-promise-and-geopolitical-power-in-the-indian-ocean-2/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
