    "description": "Buddhism could have been a unifying factor in Sri Lanka, if it had not been turned into the identity badge of the Sinhala race. The Mahawamsa mindset reshaped a historically pluralist Lanka into a Sinhala-Buddhist supremacist land",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=86577",
