    "chunk_text": "Mahindra Pik Up unveiled at Ceylon Motor Show\n\nMahindra & Mahindra Ltd., India\u2019s leading automotive giant along with Ideal Motors introduced its Pik Up Range in Sri Lanka at the Ceylon Motor Show held at the BMICH. Mahindra brings its legacy of engineering excellence with the launch of the rugged and versatile Pik Up.\n\nMahindra Pikup : Equipped with the tried and tested 2.2 litre mHAWK Turbo-diesel engine producing 140bhp and 320Nm of torque, a 7-inch touchscreen integrated infotainment system, safety features like dual airbags, ABS, ESP, rain-sensing front wipers and a reverse camera, the Mahindra Pikup is all set to disrupt the Sri Lanka market.\n\nThe models generated significant visitor interest especially from Corporate and Fleet customers as well as individual buyers.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
