    "chunk_size_bytes": 775,
    "chunk_text": "During their stay, State Minister Saeed bin Mubarak Al Hajeri and the accompanying delegation also paid courtesy calls on Minister of Foreign Affairs, Foreign Employment and Tourism Vijitha Herath and Minister of Ports and Civil Aviation Anura Karunathilaka.\n\nThe Sri Lankan delegation included Secretary to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Foreign Employment and Tourism Aruni Ranaraja, senior officials from the Ministry, and other relevant Government institutions and agencies.\n\nThe convening of the Sri Lanka\u2013UAE Joint Commission after 11 years is reflective of the strengthening of bilateral relations between the two countries, following on the recent high-level visits.\n\nThe Third Session of the Sri Lanka\u2013UAE Joint Commission is scheduled to be held in Abu Dhabi."
