    "description": "\u2018Trailblazing moment\u2019 for New Zealand-SL bilateral economic ties",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/trailblazing-moment-for-new-zealand-sl-bilateral-economic-ties/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
