    "description": "Sri Lanka\u2019s Northern Gateway: Economic promise and geopolitical power in Indian Ocean",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Sri-Lanka-s-Northern-Gateway-Economic-promise-and-geopolitical-power-in-Indian-Ocean/4-784005",
    "lang": "en",
