    "chunk_text": "He explained that while global markets remained uncertain, with weak growth in Europe and shifting trade conditions, emerging economies like Sri Lanka offered real potential. \u201cWe are very seriously working towards aligning our growth and vision with the Sri Lankan Government\u2019s vision of ensuring sustainable growth, technology, digitisation and innovation. We believe a lot of what we do gels well with the Government\u2019s vision of how the industry should perform in Sri Lanka.\u201d\n\nSince its inception in 2015, Bosch in Sri Lanka has grown into a trusted technology and services partner, supporting industries and communities through a diverse product portfolio across businesses. This 10th anniversary celebration reaffirms Bosch\u2019s long-term commitment to advancing Sri Lanka\u2019s technological and industrial future."
