    "chunk_size_bytes": 1705,
    "chunk_text": "The Anointed Trump\u2019s New Leadership Of Free-Sex Christianity\n\nDonald Trump is now the new leader of Christians, anointed by God. He is called \u201cThe New Moses.\u201d The famous Billy Graham\u2019s son, The Rev. Franklin Graham, campaigned for Trump in 2024 (see Photo). He claims that Trump, chosen by God, recently escaped death when shot at because \u201cGod turned his head and saved his life.\u201d He describes Franklin as \u201cone of America\u2019s best-known evangelists, arguably its most famous preacher.\u201d\n\nIt is not clear how, as the BBC notes, The questions asked about Trump\u2019s character \u2013 including accusations of sexual misconduct and his alleged affair with adult film star Stormy Daniels and associated\u00a0hush-money trial\u2013 don\u2019t dim Mr Graham\u2019s view [of Trump].\n\nTrump is usurping legal guardianship of Christians assuming he is anointed by God as publicly stated by Franklin Graham, the son of Billy Graham\u2019s who has a massive following in Colombo among members of Youth for Christ, Campus Crusade for Christ, Graduate Christian Fellowship, FOCUS (the Fellowship of Christian University Students, a plagiarised version of the better known and larger Fellowship of Catholic University Students), the Grace Churches, Back to the Bible, and many others. These all look to America for inspiration and have an English-speaking leadership and are easily influenced by Trump. Just knowing the Grahams make careers in these circles.\n\nAround the time I went to Colombo, the intense American influence through organisations like YFC was clear and deleterious. A typical evangelical meeting would have youths led by an older person directing and culminating it with an \u201cAre you Born Again?\u201d sermon."
