    "description": "ITAK urges President not to appoint members from security backgrounds to Office of Repatriation",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/ITAK-urges-President-not-to-appoint-members-from-security-backgrounds-to-Office-of-Repatriation/56-784054",
    "lang": "en",
