    "chunk_text": "Global Packaging Congress 2025 showcases international collaboration\n\nThe Global Packaging Congress 2025, themed \u201cPackaged to Perfection,\u201d concluded successfully on 30th October at the BMICH, Colombo, with over 300 participants representing more than 50 member countries of the World Packaging Organization (WPO) from 5 continents.\n\nOrganized by the Sri Lanka Institute of Packaging (SLIP) in collaboration with the World Packaging Organization, the Congress served as a key highlight of Packaging Week 2025, which also featured the Lankapak Exhibition, WPO Board Meetings, and the Sri Lanka Packaging Awards.\n\nThe event brought together global and local leaders from across the packaging, manufacturing, and sustainability sectors to discuss key themes such as circularity in packaging, innovation, education, and the path toward sustainable industrial growth.\n\nLevi & Dili: Styling Sri Lanka\u2019s new generation of fearless women\n\nA message of hope on the move: Kangaroo Cabs drives breast cancer awareness\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
