    "num": "dbsjeyarajcom-306e203c",
    "date_str": "2025-11-10",
    "description": "2015 \u201cMahinda Sulanga\u201d ,  2025 \u201cMaha Jana Handa\u201d and the  Politics of Holding  Mass Rallies at Nugegoda.",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=86595",
