    "description": "Hong Kong\u2019s SiS Group takes up  controlling stake in Gestetner of Ceylon",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Hong-Kong-s-SiS-Group-takes-up-controlling-stake-in-Gestetner-of-Ceylon/34-784119",
    "lang": "en",
