    "chunk_size_bytes": 1045,
    "chunk_text": "Founded in Singapore in 1983 and started as a distributor of IT products, SiS International Holdings Limited has been listed on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange since 1992. Today, it has grown to become a dynamic leading distribution company with the largest network across five countries in Asia Pacific. Over the years, it has also successfully expanded into investments in technology and securities, real estate investment, and asset management segments.\n\nGestetner of Ceylon Plc, established in 1964 and based in Colombo, is a pioneer in Sri Lanka\u2019s office automation industry. Evolving from the legacy of the iconic \u2018Roneo\u2019 machine, the company imports, distributes, and services office equipment and IT products from global brands such as Ricoh, BARCO, Dynabook, and BenQ. It also provides IT and document management solutions, along with outsourced printing, finance, and accounting services. Renowned for reliability, innovation, and service excellence, Gestetner remains a trusted leader in business technology solutions in Sri Lanka."
