    "description": "Colombo Port City can be Sri Lanka\u2019s \u2018single catalyst of growth,\u2019 says Harsha Amarasekera",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Colombo-Port-City-can-be-Sri-Lanka-s-single-catalyst-of-growth-says-Harsha-Amarasekera/34-784120",
    "lang": "en",
