    "chunk_text": "Hemas Consumer Brands Managing Director Sabrina Esufally said: \u201cBeing named the Overall Winner at JASTECA 2025, among the best organisations in Sri Lanka, is an immense honour\u2014especially as the awards return after a five-year hiatus. This recognition celebrates our operational excellence, achieved through our people\u2019s relentless pursuit of perfection and commitment to eliminating waste. It also reinforces our purpose of enriching lives through products that are not only of the highest quality but are made responsibly, sustainably, and efficiently.\u201d\n\n\u201cOur journey is defined by a bottom-up approach, with relentless efforts to eliminate waste across the value chain and create stakeholder value. Every day, our employees generate 20 to 30 innovative ideas, reflecting a deep sense of ownership and creativity. These ideas not only propel the company forward by better serving its consumers but also enhance the lives of our employees and their families.\u201d\n\nHCB\u2019s achievement at the JASTECA Awards 2025 marks a significant milestone in Sri Lanka\u2019s industrial landscape, showcasing the transformative power of lean thinking with employee-driven innovation."
