    "chunk_text": "Despite the best efforts, trust can often be fractured. No individual or relationship is immune to failure, miscommunication, or betrayal. In these moments, nurturing trust transforms into the challenging work of trust repair. The key difference between a failed relationship and a repaired one lies in the commitment to accountability and amendment.\n\nIn conclusion, trust is the only currency that matters. It accelerates execution, fuels innovation, and dissolves silos between leader, team, and client. Cultivate it relentlessly. Let mutual faith be your decisive advantage and let integrity be your compass and moderator. Avoid building in quicksand. Go forward and build, together, on the solidity of trust.\n\n(The writer is currently, a Leadership Coach, Mentor and Consultant and boasts over 50+ years of experience in very senior positions in the corporate world \u2013 local and overseas. www.ronniepeiris.com.)"
