    "chunk_size_bytes": 580,
    "chunk_text": "Those of us who worked with him and many who only knew him by reputation will remember Ravi for his courage, diplomacy, and moral clarity. In times of deep division, he reached across boundaries that others dared not cross. He spoke softly but carried conviction. He believed that decency was the first step toward peace.\n\nFarewell, our dear friend. Your life was a bridge between peoples, between worlds, between what was and what might yet be.\n\nLionel and Chitra Bopage, on behalf of the members of the Friends for Peace in Sri Lanka (FPSL) who associated with Ravi at the time."
  },
