    "description": "Dialog and MEPA Unveil Sri Lanka\u2019s First 5G-Enabled Autonomous Water-Surface Cleaning Robot",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/dialog-and-mepa-unveil-sri-lankas-first-5g-enabled-autonomous-water-surface-cleaning-robot/",
