    "md5": "43f9a1c8929751ed865a614442ac07e3",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1892,
    "chunk_text": "National Supply Chain Excellence Award Winners 2025\n\nManufacturing: Winner \u2013 Nestl\u00e9 Lanka; 1st Runner-Up \u2013 Unilever Sri Lanka; 2nd Runner-Up \u2013 Sunshine Consumer Lanka.\n\nTrading: Winner \u2013 Diesel and Motor Engineering PLC; 1st Runner-Up \u2013 D. Samson and Sons Ltd; 2nd Runner-Up \u2013 Hayleys Aventura Ltd.\n\nManufacturing: Winner \u2013 OTR Wheel Engineering Lanka Ltd; 1st Runner-Up \u2013 Gamma Interpharm Ltd; 2nd Runner-Up \u2013 Atire Ltd.\n\nService: Winner \u2013 Logistics Park Ltd; 1st Runner-Up \u2013 Eagle Logistics Colombo Ltd.\n\nManufacturing: Winner \u2013 Micro Electric International Ltd; 1st Runner-Up \u2013 Korean Spa Accessories Ltd; 2nd Runner-Up \u2013 Wayamba Printpack Ltd.\n\nService: Winner \u2013 Spectra Logistics Ltd; 1st Runner-Up \u2013 Ace Distriparks Ltd; 2nd Runner-Up \u2013 Global Transportation and Logistics Ltd.\n\nTrading: 1st Runner-Up \u2013 Unique Industrial Solutions Ltd; 2nd Runner-Up \u2013 E-Screen System Ltd.\n\nStrategic Category: Winner \u2013 Indika Kumara (Unilever Sri Lanka); 1st Runner-Up \u2013 Prashani Liyanage (Aitken Spence Logistics); 2nd Runner-Up \u2013K. L. S. Dinesh.\n\nTactical Category: Winner \u2013 R. T. S. Perera (Nestl\u00e9 Lanka); 1st Runner-Up \u2013 J. A. D. M. Jayakody (Nestl\u00e9 Lanka); 2nd Runner-Up \u2013\u00a0 U. M. L. Hewage (Annunine Holdings).\n\nMerit Awards were presented to Aranthi Sadari Fernando (Fonterra Brands Lanka), Dhanushka Samaraweera (Ceylon Agro Industries), Dr. R. A. Dillanjani Weeratunga (E. B. Creasy and Co. PLC), and D. J. M. D. Anuradha (Hirdaramani Apparels).\n\nSpecial Commendation Awards were presented to: Alumex PLC, Akbar Brothers Ltd, Ceylon Biscuits Limited, D. Samson Industries Ltd, Ansell Textiles Lanka Ltd, Hemas Manufacturing Ltd, Lion Brewery (Ceylon) PLC, Siam City Cement (Lanka) Ltd., Ceylon Agro Industries Ltd., Samson Compounds Ltd, AB Mauri Lanka Ltd, Sundaram Lanka Tyres Ltd, Finagle Lanka Ltd, Suwanda Industries and Logicare Ltd."
  },
