    "chunk_size_bytes": 693,
    "chunk_text": "Special Commendation Awards were presented to: Alumex PLC, Akbar Brothers Ltd, Ceylon Biscuits Limited, D. Samson Industries Ltd, Ansell Textiles Lanka Ltd, Hemas Manufacturing Ltd, Lion Brewery (Ceylon) PLC, Siam City Cement (Lanka) Ltd., Ceylon Agro Industries Ltd., Samson Compounds Ltd, AB Mauri Lanka Ltd, Sundaram Lanka Tyres Ltd, Finagle Lanka Ltd, Suwanda Industries and Logicare Ltd.\n\nThe 2025 celebration underscored ISMM\u2019s ongoing mission to promote excellence, innovation, and professionalism in Sri Lanka\u2019s supply chain ecosystem. It also reaffirmed the importance of the supply chain sector as a driving force of national competitiveness, sustainability, and economic growth."
