    "description": "NCCSL hosts post-Budget seminar, highlights development focus and fiscal discipline",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/NCCSL-hosts-post-Budget-seminar-highlights-development-focus-and-fiscal-discipline/34-784294",
