    "date_str": "2025-11-13",
    "description": "If The Private Sector Is To Be The Engine Of Economic Growth",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.colombotelegraph.com/index.php/if-the-private-sector-is-to-be-the-engine-of-economic-growth/",
