    "description": "Is Anura\u2019s Budget A Breath Of Life For Big Business, A Death Warrant For The Little Guy?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.colombotelegraph.com/index.php/is-anuras-budget-a-breath-of-life-for-big-business-a-death-warrant-for-the-little-guy/",
