    "chunk_text": "She noted that while the state bears the ultimate responsibility of preventing and prosecuting such gendered violence, a broader shift towards a democratic political culture that accepts women\u2019s equal right to participate is also vital.\u00a0 Globally, only a few countries, like Denmark, have attempted to combat AI deepfakes by giving citizens copyright over their face, voice, and physical likeness.\n\nHowever, unless underlying \u201chonour\u201d-based norms and political power structures are challenged, legal reforms alone will fall short. Protecting women in public roles, therefore, demands not just stronger legal frameworks, but also cultural awareness, social change, and community support."
