    "description": "ICC Sri Lanka signs National Committee Partnership Agreement with ICC Academy in Singapore",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/ICC-Sri-Lanka-signs-National-Committee-Partnership-Agreement-with-ICC-Academy-in-Singapore/34-784324",
    "lang": "en",
